          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この先7夜：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The peak falls in daylight or twilight here, so only the edges of it reach a dark sky.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Maximum fällt hier in Tageslicht oder Dämmerung, daher erreichen nur seine Ränder einen dunklen Himmel."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The peak falls in daylight or twilight here, so only the edges of it reach a dark sky."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí el máximo cae de día o durante el crepúsculo, así que solo sus extremos llegan a un cielo oscuro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ici, le maximum tombe de jour ou au crépuscule, si bien que seules ses marges profitent d’un ciel noir."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここでは極大が昼間か薄明の時間に重なるため、暗い空で見られるのはその前後だけです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The peak falls while the radiant is low here, so few meteors reach this sky.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Maximum fällt hier in eine Zeit, in der der Radiant tief steht, daher erreichen wenige Meteore diesen Himmel."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The peak falls while the radiant is low here, so few meteors reach this sky."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí el máximo llega con el radiante bajo, así que pocos meteoros alcanzan este cielo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ici, le maximum tombe alors que le radiant est bas, si bien que peu de météores atteignent ce ciel."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここでは極大のとき放射点が低いため、この空に届く流星はわずかです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The public coordinates of the %lld national parks. Nothing about you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die öffentlichen Koordinaten der %lld Nationalparks. Nichts über dich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The public coordinates of the %lld national parks. Nothing about you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las coordenadas públicas de los %lld parques nacionales. Nada sobre ti."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les coordonnées publiques des %lld parcs nationaux. Rien sur vous."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lldの国立公園の公開座標だけです。あなたについての情報は含まれません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die veröffentlichte Maximalrate beträgt %lld pro Stunde unter einem perfekten Himmel, mit dem Radianten, dem Punkt, aus dem die Meteore zu kommen scheinen, direkt über dir (International Meteor Organization)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tasa máxima publicada es de %lld por hora con un cielo perfecto y el radiante, el punto del que parecen salir los meteoros, en el cenit (Organización Internacional de Meteoros)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le taux maximal publié est de %lld par heure sous un ciel parfait, avec le radiant, le point d’où semblent venir les météores, au zénith (International Meteor Organization)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公表されている極大時の出現数は、理想的な空で、放射点（流星が飛び出してくるように見える点）が天頂にあるとき、1時間に%lld個です（国際流星機構）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization); it varies from year to year.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die veröffentlichte Maximalrate beträgt %lld pro Stunde unter einem perfekten Himmel, mit dem Radianten, dem Punkt, aus dem die Meteore zu kommen scheinen, direkt über dir (International Meteor Organization); sie schwankt von Jahr zu Jahr."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization); it varies from year to year."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tasa máxima publicada es de %lld por hora con un cielo perfecto y el radiante, el punto del que parecen salir los meteoros, en el cenit (Organización Internacional de Meteoros); varía de un año a otro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le taux maximal publié est de %lld par heure sous un ciel parfait, avec le radiant, le point d’où semblent venir les météores, au zénith (International Meteor Organization) ; il varie d’une année à l’autre."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公表されている極大時の出現数は、理想的な空で、放射点（流星が飛び出してくるように見える点）が天頂にあるとき、1時間に%lld個です（国際流星機構）。年によって変わります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sky at %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Himmel um %@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sky at %@"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El cielo: %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le ciel à %@"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@の空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The summit sits above most low cloud, so the score counts mid and high cloud only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Gipfel liegt über den meisten tiefen Wolken, daher zählt der Wert nur mittelhohe und hohe Wolken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The summit sits above most low cloud, so the score counts mid and high cloud only."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cumbre queda por encima de casi toda la nube baja, así que el índice solo cuenta las nubes medias y altas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le sommet domine la plupart des nuages bas : l’indice ne compte donc que les nuages moyens et hauts."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "山頂はほとんどの低い雲より上にあるため、スコアには中層雲と上層雲だけを数えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thin high cloud; bright stars only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dünne hohe Wolken; nur helle Sterne."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thin high cloud; bright stars only."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nubes altas y finas; solo estrellas brillantes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nuages hauts et fins ; étoiles brillantes seulement."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "薄い上層雲。明るい星だけが見えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This score counts the Moon and darkness only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Wert berücksichtigt nur Mond und Dunkelheit."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This score counts the Moon and darkness only."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este índice solo cuenta la Luna y la oscuridad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet indice ne compte que la Lune et l’obscurité."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このスコアは月と暗さだけで計算しています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This score uses the usual %@ clouds at %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Wert nutzt die übliche Bewölkung im %@ in %@."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This score uses the usual %@ clouds at %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este índice usa la nubosidad habitual de %@ en %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet indice utilise la nébulosité habituelle à %2$@ en %1$@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このスコアには、%2$@の%1$@の平年の雲量を使っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time of night": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uhrzeit"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time of night"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hora de la noche"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heure de la nuit"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "夜の時刻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Times are park-local. Moonrise and moonset are good to within a few minutes, planets to about a degree. In the sky, the Moon is drawn larger than life so its phase reads; its place is true.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Zeiten sind Ortszeit des Parks. Mondaufgang und Monduntergang sind auf wenige Minuten genau, Planeten auf etwa ein Grad. Am Himmel ist der Mond größer gezeichnet, als er ist, damit seine Phase erkennbar ist; sein Ort stimmt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Times are park-local. Moonrise and moonset are good to within a few minutes, planets to about a degree. In the sky, the Moon is drawn larger than life so its phase reads; its place is true."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las horas son las locales del parque. La salida y la puesta de la Luna tienen un margen de pocos minutos; los planetas, de un grado. En el cielo, la Luna se dibuja más grande de lo real para que se lea su fase; su posición es la verdadera."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les heures sont celles du parc. Le lever et le coucher de la Lune sont précis à quelques minutes près, les planètes à environ un degré. Dans le ciel, la Lune est dessinée plus grande que nature pour que sa phase se lise ; sa position est exacte."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "時刻は公園の現地時間です。月の出と月の入りの誤差は数分以内、惑星の位置の誤差は約1度です。空の中の月は、満ち欠けがわかるように実際より大きく描いていますが、位置は正確です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
